      "id": "claim_c230ee8ebc5f4f4b8db1972fc144758b",
      "statement": "`paraphe store relocate` is the documented upgrade route: it copies the store retained at the legacy location to the current per-user default, leaving the source in place as a backup unless `--move` is given, and configuring `store_path` to the retained path remains the alternative.",
